  "fulltext_xhtml": "<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta name=\"pdf:PDFVersion\" content=\"1.7\">\n<meta name=\"dc:title\" content=\"Example\">\n<title>Example head title</title>\n</head>\n<body><div class=\"page\"><p></p>\n<p>Ada Example and Ben Example  \nGlenn Research Center, Cleveland, Ohio\n</p>\n<p>Example Cryogenic Tank Insulation Test Results\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"page\"><p>Results &amp; discussion  \nThe measured boil-off was 0.1 percent per day, &lt;0.2 as required.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Heat leak below prediction at the warm boundary</li>\n<li>Above it at the cold boundary</li></ul>\n</div>\n</body></html>",
  "fulltext_plain": "\n\n\n\n\n\nExample Report Cover\n\n\n\n\nNASA/TM-2025-000002   \n\nSection 1. Purpose\nThe demonstration transfers example propellant between two tanks.\n\n\n\nSection 2. Boil-off\nBoil-off during transfer is expected to stay under 1 percent.\n"
